      "writtenOn": "2024-11-08T18:39:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That link is to a keymaster specific interface. Is ISharedSecret also a keymaster(/keymint) interface? If so should this be KEYMINT_SHARED_HMAC_KEY, or is this a key that every client of IHwCryptoKey should have access to?",
      "parentUuid": "4e63e115_60232380",
      "revId": "6c7f6b1496342ef878dc73cffcd75a75c19623d3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
